    "content": "<h1>Houston Truck Accident Settlement Strategies: 2026 Guide to Maximize Compensation</h1>\n\n<p>We need exactly 2 <p>...</p> tags. No extra tags. So output will be:</p>\n\n<p> ... </p>\n<p> ... </p>\n\n<p>We must ensure no extra characters outside those tags. Also no extra newline? Probably fine.</p>\n\n<p>We need 150 words total across both paragraphs. Let's craft 150 words exactly. Count words.</p>\n\n<p>Paragraph 1: maybe 75 words. Paragraph 2: 75 words. Let's draft.</p>\n\n<p>\"Houston Truck Accident Settlement Strategies\" is the target phrase. Let's start: \"Houston Truck Accident Settlement Strategies are essential for victims seeking fair compensation after a collision involving commercial vehicles.\" That's 13 words? Let's count: Houston(1) Truck(2) Accident(3) Settlement(4) Strategies(5) are(6) essential(7) for(8) victims(9) seeking(10) fair(11) compensation(12) after(13) a(14) collision(15) involving(16) commercial(17) vehicles(18). That's 18 words. Good.</p>\n\n<p>Paragraph 1 text:</p>\n\n<p>\"Houston Truck Accident Settlement Strategies are essential for victims seeking fair compensation after a collision involving commercial vehicles. In 2026, the legal  in Texas has evolved, making proactive planning critical. Understanding liability, insurance coverage, and medical documentation can dramatically influence the outcome. This guide breaks down each step, from immediate scene preservation to negotiating with insurers, ensuring you protect your rights and maximize potential recovery. Early action, thorough evidence collection, and strategic legal counsel form the backbone of a successful claim.\"</p>\n\n<p>Houston(1) Truck(2) Accident(3) Settlement(4) Strategies(5) are(6) essential(7) for(8) victims(9) seeking(10) fair(11) compensation(12) after(13) a(14) collision(15) involving(16) commercial(17) vehicles.(18) In(19) 2026,(20) the(21) legal(22) (23) in(24) Texas(25) has(26) evolved,(27) making(28) proactive(29) planning(30) critical.(31)