tner\" or \"violation of vehicle code\" helps decode the report's implications for liability and guides strategic legal analysis.</p>\n<p>Advanced accident reconstruction utilizes sensor data, dashcam footage, and vehicle telemetry to recreate impact dynamics, establishing causation with scientific precision. Emerging technologies, including autonomous driving systems and driver-assist features, introduce new variables that affect fault determination, requiring careful documentation and expert testimony. Strategic steps include preserving digital evidence, securing witness statements promptly, and engaging forensic specialists to counteract unfair liability claims.</p>\nMeta Description: Comprehensive 2026 guide on California accident fault rules, police report decoding, reconstruction data, tech impacts, and protecting against unfair liability claims.\n\n<p>Now count characters of meta description: \"Comprehensive 2026 guide on California accident fault rules, police report decoding, reconstruction data, tech impacts, and protecting against unfair liability claims.\"</p>\n\n<p>String: \nComprehensive 2026 guide on California accident fault rules, police report decoding, reconstruction data, tech impacts, and protecting against unfair liability claims.</p>\n\n<p>Count characters:</p>\n\n<p>I'll count manually.</p>\n\n<p>\"Comprehensive\" = 12\nspace =1 =>13\n\"2026\"=4 =>17\nspace=1 =>18\n\"guide\"=5 =>23\nspace=1 =>24\n\"on\"=2 =>26\nspace=1 =>27\n\"California\"=10 =>37\nspace=1 =>38\n\"accident\"=8 =>46\nspace=1 =>47\n\"fault\"=5 =>52\nspace=1 =>53\n\"rules,\"=6 (including comma) =>59\nspace=1 =>60\n\"police\"=6 =>66\nspace=1 =>67\n\"report\"=6 =>73\nspace=1 =>74\n\"decoding,\"=9 (including comma) =>83\nspace=1 =>84\n\"reconstruction\"=13 =>97\nspace=1 =>98\n\"data,\"=5 =>103\nspace=1 =>104\n\"tech\"=4 =>108\nspace=1 =>109\n\"impacts,\"=8 =>117\nspace=1 =>118\n\"and\"=3 =>121\nspace=1 =>122\n\"protecting\"=10 =>132\nspace=1 =>133\n\"against\"=7 =>140\nspace=1 =>14